TI  - Relationship Between Trust in the Artificial Intelligence Creator and Trust in Artificial Intelligence Systems: The Crucial Role of Artificial Intelligence Alignment and Steerability
T2  - JOURNAL OF MANAGEMENT INFORMATION SYSTEMS
