TI  - Fair contracts for artificial intelligence?
T2  - BEHAVIORAL AND BRAIN SCIENCES
LA  - English
AB  - This comment explores resource-rational contractualism (RRC) as a framework for artificial intelligence (AI) alignment and reasoning. It assesses RRC's capacity to capture the insights of philosophical contractualism and canvasses its extension to AI alignment. It suggests that a modified version of RRC, centered on impartial deliberation, can be used to identify principles for alignment and to guide efficient AI moral cognition.
