TI  - An Instructible Chemist-AI Alignment Framework for Generating Quaternary Ammonium Compound Structures
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 31ST ACM SIGKDD CONFERENCE ON KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY AND DATA MINING V.2, KDD 2025
