TI  - Enhancing Fine-Tuning LLM Evaluation: A Study on Calibration and Metrics for Industry-Specific AI Alignment
T2  - 2025 IEEE CONFERENCE ON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, CAI
LA  - English
