TI  - Teleological Empathy: A Comprehensive Journey Through Its Conceptualization, Functional Characteristics, Ethical Challenges and Future Perspectives in the Contemporary Social Sciences
T2  - ADVANCES IN HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - D91
KW  - J24
KW  - L86
KW  - O33
