TI  - Hybrid Strategies Towards Safe "Self-Aware" Superintelligent Systems
T2  - ARTIFICIAL GENERAL INTELLIGENCE, AGI 2018
LA  - English
CP  - 11th International Conference on Artificial General Intelligence (AGI) held as part of the Joint Multi-Conference on Human-Level Artificial Intelligence (HLAI)
