TI  - XAI2Brain: A Perspective on Mechanistic Interpretability for Brain-AI Alignment
T2  - MACHINE LEARNING AND KNOWLEDGE EXTRACTION
LA  - English
KW  - explainable AI (XAI)
KW  - neuroscience-AI alignment
KW  - human-in-the-loop
