TI  - To Mask or to Mirror: Human-AI Alignment in Collective Reasoning
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2025 CONFERENCE ON EMPIRICAL METHODS IN NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING
LA  - English
CP  - 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing-EMNLP
KW  - GENDER
