AB  - Large language models (LLMs) not only mimic human language generally but are also showing the ability to exhibit nuanced, idiosyncratic human behavior. This could lead to the expanded use of LLMs in research and a diminution of the influence of humans. It also has implications for AI alignment and the role of the technology in society.
