TI  - Deciphering AI Decision-Making: A Generalizable Framework of Human-AI Misalignment
T2  - COMPUTING IN CIVIL ENGINEERING 2024: ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, AUTOMATION AND ROBOTICS, AND HUMAN-CENTERED INNOVATIONS
LA  - English
