TI  - CPMETRIC: Deep Siamese Networks for Metric Learning on Structured Preferences
T2  - ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE. IJCAI 2019 INTERNATIONAL WORKSHOPS
LA  - English
CP  - 28th International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence-IJCAI
KW  - Metric learning
KW  - Value alignment
