AB  - With the advancement of AI technology, the appearance of intelligent autonomous care robots in our society is likely in the foreseeable future. My research focuses on the ethical dimensions in the autonomous care robots' decisions and actions. In this paper I will first present the partial result of an online survey that I launched in March 2022. The survey, entitled "Human-in-the-Loop Ethical AI for Social Robots," polls people's opinions on what kind of virtues they would like our future care robots to demonstrate. I will then explicate how Confucian virtue ethics can respond to human expectations of what kind of virtuous care robots we want in our society.
