TI  - Exploring People's Application Behavior of Electronic Certificates from the Behavioral Reasoning Theory Perspective: A Mixed-Method Approach
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - Electronic certificates
KW  - behavioral reasoning theory
KW  - regulatory focus theory
KW  - value alignment
