AB  - Norms are an instrument to coordinate societies, but deciding which norms to enact is a difficult task. Not only norms might have incompatibilities between themselves, such as norms contradicting other norms, but also the cost of implementation can be an important aspect to consider. Furthermore, due to the growing social interest in ethics and the ethical impact norms can have, this ethical implications should also be examined during the decision making process.
