TI  - The economics of p(doom): Scenarios of existential risk and economic growth in the age of transformative AI
T2  - ECONOMIC MODELLING
LA  - English
KW  - Transformative Artificial Intelligence (TAI)
KW  - Economic growth
KW  - Technological singularity
