TI  - Abstraction Alignment: Comparing Model-Learned and Human-Encoded Conceptual Relationships
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2025 CHI CONFERENCE ON HUMAN FACTORS IN COMPUTING SYTEMS, CHI 2025
LA  - English
