TI  - Second Thoughts are Best: Learning to Re-AlignWith Human Values from Text Edits
T2  - ADVANCES IN NEURAL INFORMATION PROCESSING SYSTEMS 35 (NEURIPS 2022)
LA  - English
CP  - 36th Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)
AB  - We present SECOND THOUGHTS, a new learning paradigm that enables language models (LMs) to re-align with human values. By modeling the chain-of-edits between value-unaligned and value-aligned text, with LM fine-tuning and additional refinement through reinforcement learning, SECOND THOUGHTS not only achieves superior performance in three value alignment benchmark datasets but also shows strong human-value transfer learning ability in few-shot scenarios. The generated editing steps also offer better interpretability and ease for interactive error correction. Extensive human evaluations further confirm its effectiveness.
