TI  - Dynamic Time-Warping Correction for Shifts in Ultrahigh Resolving Power Ion Mobility Spectrometry and Structures for Lossless Ion Manipulations
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN SOCIETY FOR MASS SPECTROMETRY
LA  - English
KW  - data alignment
KW  - dynamic time warping
KW  - ion mobility spectrometry (IMS)
