TI  - Preserving the Integrity of Evidence-Based Social Work in the Age of AI: A Proposed Ethical Framework
T2  - JOURNAL OF EVIDENCE-BASED SOCIAL WORK
LA  - English
KW  - Artificial Intelligence
KW  - evidence-based practice
KW  - research-informed practice
KW  - social work code of ethics
