TI  - Why Certify? Motivations, Outcomes and the Importance of Facilitating Organizations in Certification of Community-Based Forestry Initiatives
T2  - SMALL-SCALE FORESTRY
LA  - English
KW  - Certification
KW  - Community-based forestry
KW  - Community forestry
