TI  - Whose Truth? Pluralistic Geo-Alignment for (Agentic) AI
T2  - 33RD ACM SIGSPATIAL INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ADVANCES IN GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS, ACM SIGSPATIAL 2025
LA  - English
