TI  - From Pursuit of the Universal AGI Architecture to Systematic Approach to Heterogeneous AGI (SAGI): Addressing Alignment, Energy & AGI Grand Challenges
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SEMANTIC COMPUTING
LA  - English
KW  - Artificial general intelligence
KW  - system design
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - AI hardware
KW  - BRAINS DEFAULT NETWORK
