TI  - Organizational identification among Brazilian public employees: a study of the cultural sector
T2  - RBGN-REVISTA BRASILEIRA DE GESTAO DE NEGOCIOS
LA  - English
KW  - Organizational identification
KW  - value alignment
KW  - organizational citizenship
