TI  - Algorithmic Empowerment and Its Impact on Circular Economy Participation: An Empirical Study Based on Human-Machine Collaborative Decision-Making Mechanisms
T2  - JOURNAL OF THEORETICAL AND APPLIED ELECTRONIC COMMERCE RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - algorithmic empowerment
KW  - human-machine trust
KW  - circular commerce
