TI  - Sustainable "green citizen" mechanism: a micro-level theorisation of newcomer socialisation, person-organisation fit and organisational identification
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ORGANIZATIONAL ANALYSIS
LA  - English
KW  - Sustainability
KW  - Green citizen
KW  - Socialisation
