TI  - UNDERSTANDING THE ROLE OF GOVERNMENT AND BUYERS IN SUPPLIER ENERGY EFFICIENCY INITIATIVES
T2  - JOURNAL OF SUPPLY CHAIN MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - stakeholder theory
KW  - energy efficiency
KW  - buyer-supplier relationship
KW  - government influence
KW  - environmental decision-making
