TI  - Transformational, Transactional, and Ethical Leadership in Sustainable Family Entrepreneurship: A Global Systematic Review
T2  - ADMINISTRATIVE SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - entrepreneurship
KW  - sustainable leadership
KW  - succession planning
KW  - transformational leadership
KW  - ethical leadership
