TI  - Construct the Exemplary Chinese Police Image: Public Perceptions and Generational Differences
T2  - FWU JOURNAL OF SOCIAL SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - exemplary police image
KW  - generational differences
KW  - qualitative study
KW  - image positioning
