TI  - Development and performance evaluation of a microbiological method for screening and LC-MS/MS for conformation of sulfonamides in animal-derived foods
T2  - FOOD ADDITIVES AND CONTAMINANTS PART A-CHEMISTRY ANALYSIS CONTROL EXPOSURE & RISK ASSESSMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Microbiological screening method
KW  - Bacillus megaterium
KW  - sulfonamide
KW  - animal-derived food
