KW  - MULTI-RESIDUE DETERMINATION
KW  - TANDEM MASS-SPECTROMETRY
KW  - VETERINARY DRUG RESIDUES
KW  - LIQUID-CHROMATOGRAPHY
KW  - ANTIBIOTIC-RESIDUES
KW  - SAMPLE PREPARATION
KW  - VALIDATION
KW  - PRODUCTS
